{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25481","headline":"思平泉树石杂咏一十首 重台芙蓉 · 李德裕","name":"思平泉树石杂咏一十首 重台芙蓉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芙蓉含露时，秀色波中溢。\n玉女袭朱裳，重重映皓质。\n晨霞耀丹景，片片明秋日。\n兰泽多衆芳，妍姿不相匹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25481.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25481","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}